

## 1. Project Overview

PrimeMart FMCG Analytics is a synthetic enterprise FMCG Business Intelligence project designed to demonstrate an end-to-end analytics workflow using Python, SQL Server and Power BI.

The solution covers sales, profitability, customers, products, inventory, procurement and store performance.

---

## 2. Data Warehouse Structure

The warehouse follows a dimensional modelling approach consisting of dimension and fact tables.

### Dimension Tables

| Table | Description |
|---|---|
| DimDate | Calendar and time intelligence dimension |
| DimCustomer | Customer demographic and commercial information |
| DimEmployee | Employee and organizational information |
| DimProduct | Product, pricing and inventory attributes |
| DimStore | Store location, capacity and operating information |
| DimSupplier | Supplier and procurement information |

### Fact Tables

| Table | Description |
|---|---|
| FactSales | Sales transactions |
| FactPurchases | Procurement transactions |
| FactInventory | Store-level product inventory |

---

## 3. DimProduct

Contains the master information for products sold across PrimeMart stores.

Key attributes include:

- ProductID
- SKU
- ProductName
- Brand
- Category
- SubCategory
- UnitOfMeasure
- PackageSize
- UnitCost
- SellingPrice
- ProfitMarginPct
- VATRate
- ReorderLevel
- SafetyStock
- LaunchDate
- Status

**Primary Key:** ProductID

