## 13. Data Generation

The dataset is synthetic and was generated using Python.

The generated environment includes approximately:

- 5,000 products
- 50,000 customers
- 300 suppliers
- 80 stores
- 800 employees
- 500,000 sales transactions
- 150,000 purchase transactions
- 20,000 returns

The synthetic nature of the data means the project is intended for demonstration, portfolio and analytical modelling purposes rather than real-world operational decision-making.
